"><span tts:ruby="base">雪</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="05:59.768" end="06:00.046">ゆ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="06:00.046" end="06:00.256">き</span></span></span><span begin="06:00.256" end="06:01.594">に</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">向着雪我如此祈愿</span></p><p xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xml:id="25b9e585-9980-4e80-b02b-897ee640b0f4" itunes:key="25b9e585-9980-4e80-b02b-897ee640b0f4" begin="06:01.594" end="06:04.377" ttm:agent="v2 v1"><span begin="06:01.594" end="06:03.043" tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">願</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="06:01.594" end="06:02.662">ね</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="06:02.662" end="06:03.043">が</span></span></span><span begin="06:03.043" end="06:04.377">う</span></p><p xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xml:id="L38" itunes:key="L38" begin="06:04.377" end="06:09.907" ttm:agent="v1 v2"><span begin="06:04.377" end="06:04.932">I</span> <span begin="06:04.932" end="06:05.826">still</span> <span begin="06:05.826" end="06:06.847">love</span> <span begin="06:06.847" end="06:09.907">you</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我依然爱着你</span></p></div></body></tt>